OL,3,GNEWSAMP wants national standard for bus
OL,4,Ashelters
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP said she wanted a national
OL,7,Fstandard put in place for bus stops.
OL,9,FLabour's Alex Mayer, who represents
OL,10,FDunstable and Leighton Buzzard, led a
OL,11,FWestminster debate where she called for
OL,12,Fstops to be as good as award-winning
OL,13,Fshelters in Dunstable and Norwich.
OL,15,FMayer said: "I want brilliant bus stops
OL,16,Fthat offer a promise of a great journey
OL,17,Fand [I] genuinely believe better bus
OL,18,Fstops will encourage more passengers,
OL,19,Fwhich is what we need for a thriving
OL,20,Fnetwork."
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
