OL,3,GNEWSAMP wants national standard for bus
OL,4,Ashelters
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, roads minister Justin Madders
OL,7,Fsaid: "The needs of a busy urban
OL,8,Finterchange differ significantly from a
OL,9,Flightly used rural stop, and careful
OL,10,Fconsideration would need to be given
OL,11,Fbefore prescribing a uniform national
OL,12,Fstandard."
